  "description": "Truvio PowerTools — a growing suite of admin power tools for Dynamicweb 10 by JustDynamics, in one dedicated \"PowerTools\" area of the administration.\n\nIncluded tools:\n• Content Access Viewer — opens straight on the overview; pick any security account (role, group, or user - searchable) and a website from the toolbar and see its effective CONTENT access across pages, grid rows, and paragraphs. Denials explain the gate: which rule blocks, and who IS granted.\n• Content Access Warnings — content-permission misconfiguration findings: ineffective group grants, gated sign-in pages, ignored legacy permission columns, orphaned grants.\n• Price Explainer — pick a user (or the anonymous visitor) and a product: can they see it, what do they pay, and why — the assortment that grants or blocks it, the price-matrix row that wins and why every other row lost, the product discounts that apply; switch currency, shop, quantity and date.\n• Operations Console — install health in one place: scheduled tasks (state, runs, who ran them, failing and stale tasks), integration activities (last result, broken task→activity links), logs and storage (log folders and largest tables, retention, growth findings), recent changes.\n• Index & Query Inspector — repositories and indexes with build status and schema, field where-used (dangling and unused fields), a query linter (incl. the blank-parameter leak that returns the whole index), and a live document browser that searches every schema field, shows where a term hits, and diffs product documents against the database.\n• Query Tester — run any repository query with your own parameter values and see the hits, the executed Lucene query, a clause-by-clause trace, each clause's impact, why a given document is missing, facet counts, and what to change; results carry search highlighting (where each value occurs, database texts included) and a per-document explanation panel; a finished test is a shareable link.\n• Settings — tune every tool: linter suppressions, thresholds, caps, presets, per-section toggles.\n\nEvery list has toolbar search.\n\nRequires Dynamicweb 10.8 or newer. Issues and feature requests: https://github.com/justdynamics/Truvio.Commerce.PowerTools/issues",
